<title>UK: Stakis checks in with higher year profits.</title>
<headline>Stakis checks in with higher year profits.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Sept 29</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		5.79		   vs 4.93</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.2		    vs 0.9406</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 2.15		   vs 1.75</p>
<p> Pretax		     29.2		   vs 25.8</p>
<p> Turnover		   205.6		  vs 173.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Hotels and casinos group Stakis Plc said its profit before tax and exceptional items rose 29 percent to 30.7 million stg, from 24.9 million stg a year ago.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
